(1) THE LADDER — is p_n linear?   (CALIBRATION)
==============================================================================
p_1..p_26 used as letters   2 .. 101   (factor 50.5 over 26 steps)
FERMAT F_0..F_3             3 .. 257   (factor 85.7 over 4 steps)

 n   p_n   n*ln(n)   ratio     which Fermat band
