primes available per Fermat band, up to the 313 pool
  gen 0    2 primes available
  gen 1    1 primes available
  gen 2    4 primes available
  gen 3   48 primes available
  gen 4   10 primes available
letters actually assigned   {0: 2, 1: 1, 2: 4, 3: 19}

VERDICT (1): p_n / (n ln n) stays within a factor of ~1.2 across the range,
so the ladder is QUASI-linear. Cutting it at doubly-exponential thresholds
is the whole source of the 2/1/4/19 lopsidedness. That claim stands.

